<article class="panel integration"><h2>External data API <?=($source['status']??'')==='configured'?'<span class="saved">Configured</span>':''?></h2><p>Connect a permitted ATS/HR API using Basic Auth, bearer token or API key. This saves connection details; importing data will use the configured endpoint later.</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=csrfToken()?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="external_api"><div class="form-grid"><div><label>Source name</label><input class="control" name="source_name" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($source['name']??'')?>" placeholder="Company ATS"></div><div><label>Authentication</label><select class="control" name="auth_type"><option value="basic">Username + password</option><option value="bearer" <?=($source['auth_type']??'')==='bearer'?'selected':''?>>Bearer token</option><option value="api_key" <?=($source['auth_type']??'')==='api_key'?'selected':''?>>API key</option></select></div><div class="wide"><label>Base URL</label><input class="control" type="url" name="base_url" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($source['base_url']??'')?>" placeholder="https://api.example.com/candidates"></div><div><label>Username</label><input class="control" name="username" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($source['username']??'')?>"></div><div><label>Password</label><input class="control" type="password" name="password" placeholder="<?=!empty($source['password'])?'Saved — leave blank to keep':'Password'?>"></div><div><label>Token / API key</label><input class="control" type="password" name="token" placeholder="<?=!empty($source['token'])?'Saved — leave blank to keep':'Optional token'?>"></div><div><label>Candidate data path</label><input class="control" name="data_path" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($source['data_path']??'')?>" placeholder="data.candidates"></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i>Save API source</button></div></form></article>
